                               Configuration Program
                                for ZenIRCd 0.1.0-git
                                    
This program will help you to compile your IRC server, and ask you
questions regarding the compile-time settings of it during the process. 

Project page:
https://github.com/zenircd/zenircd

Upstream installation guide (still useful while ZenIRCd docs are developed):
https://www.unrealircd.org/docs/Installing_from_source

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The full release notes are available in doc/RELEASE-NOTES.md
For easier viewing, check out the latest online release notes at:
https://github.com/zenircd/zenircd/blob/main/doc/RELEASE-NOTES.md

ZenIRCd is based on UnrealIRCd 6 and is compatible with the following services:
* anope 2.0.x (stable) with the "unreal4" protocol module - anope 2.0.7 or higher required
* anope 2.1.x (dev) with the "unreal4" / "zenircd" protocol module
* atheme with the "unreal4" protocol module - tested with version 7.2.9

